    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d50-a1-a6">

                <pb facs="0083" n="59" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg59"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord
                        Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 11, 1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord:</hi>Recurring-to your note of the 4th ultimo
                    respecting the arrival in Havana of a thousand imported negroes, in which the
                    desire of her Majesty’s government for any information on the subject is
                    signified, I have the honor to enclose a copy of a despatch of the 5th instant
                    from the United States consul general at that port which relates to the
                    matter.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, my lord, your obedient
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.,
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d50-a1-a6-a1.xml" xpointer="d50-a1-a6-a1"/>
